rcase text-anthracite group-hover:text-yellow\">\n                        <a href=\"/activity/humpback-whale-watching-tour-mafia/\">Humpback Whale watching tour Mafia</a>\n                    </h3>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">Near the archipelago of Mafia, you can witness the seasonal migration of humpback whales as they move between the warm waters of the Indian Ocean and the cooler feeding grounds closer to South Africa. Step on a traditional dhow to go spot these giants of the ocean. Once the whales are in sight the boat […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/humpback-whale-watching-tour-mafia/\" data-id=\"14766\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14800":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5-60x40.jpg 60w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/marimbani-sandbank-5.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 le