rose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">The last remnants of the ancient city of Kua lay nestled among the overgrown forests in the south of Juani Island, part of the Mafia Archipelago. The ruins date back to the 12th century, but it’s not clear why the city ceased to exist. Experience the spooky but beautiful ambience of these ruins, with the […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/visit-the-ruins-of-the-city-of-kua/\" data-id=\"14810\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14816":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"575\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-1024x575.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-1024x575.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-300x169.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-768x431.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-1536x863.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-2048x1151.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-island-60x34.jpg 60w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" title=\"Wishlist\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-10 h-10 text-2xl leading-none bg-white rounded-full transition-colors group text-anthracite\" data-wishlist-post-id=\"14816\" data-wishlist-post-type=\"excursions\">\n                <span class=\"i-ic-baseline-favorite-border group-hover:hidden\"></span>\n                <span class=\"hidden i-ic-baseline-favorite text-red group-hover:block\"></span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"card-label bg-beige\">\n                Mafia            </span>\n            </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"relative w-full px-5 py-8 lg:pr-14 lg:pl-10\">\n        <div class=\"relative flex flex-col w-full\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-sm mb-2 lg:mb-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-6 tracking-wider text-gray-900 uppercase text-anthracite group-hover:text-yellow\">\n                        <a href=\"/activity/chole-island/\">Visit Chole Island</a>\n                    </h3>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">Chole Island is a small island just across a small channel from Mafia Island. It belongs to the Mafia Archipelago and makes for a nice visit because of its history, its ruins and the lush vegetation covering the island. After a short boat ride you land on Chole’s beach, after which you walk along the […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/chole-island/\" data-id=\"14816\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14820":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/chole-bay-snorkelling-within-mafia-island-archipelago-1-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" lo