clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">The Blue Lagoon is an enormous natural infinity pool that changes with the tides. Located near Juani Island in the Mafia archipelago, the Blue Lagoon makes for a perfect trip for anyone spending a few days on Mafia. A boat takes you in 30 minutes to this unique spot, through a channel bordered by lush […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/blue-lagoon/\" data-id=\"14820\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14824":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IM_TZ_ZNZ_Sunset-cruise-Mafia-Island_Boats-at-sunset-60x40.jpg 60w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" title=\"Wishlist\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-10 h-10 text-2xl leading-none bg-white rounded-full transition-colors group text-anthracite\" data-wishlist-post-id=\"14824\" data-wishlist-post-type=\"excursions\">\n                <span class=\"i-ic-baseline-favorite-border group-hover:hidden\"></span>\n                <span class=\"hidden i-ic-baseline-favorite text-red group-hover:block\"></span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"card-label bg-beige\">\n                Mafia            </span>\n            </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"relative w-full px-5 py-8 lg:pr-14 lg:pl-10\">\n        <div class=\"relative flex flex-col w-full\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-sm mb-2 lg:mb-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-6 tracking-wider text-gray-900 uppercase text-anthracite group-hover:text-yellow\">\n                        <a href=\"/activity/sunset-cruise-mafia-island/\">Sunset Cruise Mafia Island</a>\n                    </h3>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">After a wonderful day on mesmerizing Mafia Island, there is nothing better than to jump aboard a traditional dhow for an impressive Mafian sunset at sea. The dhow departs at 5:30 pm with a waiter and drinks on board, after which the captain gently sails you through Mafia’s aquamarine waters. Once he has found a […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/sunset-cruise-mafia-island/\" data-id=\"14824\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14827":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank-1024x768.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank-1024x768.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank-300x225.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank-768x576.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank-60x45.jpg 60w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Mange_Sandbank.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" title=\"Wishlist\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-10 h-10 text-2xl leading-none bg-white rounded-full transition-colors group text-anthracite\" data-wishlist-post-id=\"14827\" data-wishlist-post-type=\"excursions\">\n                <span class=\"i-ic-baseline-favorite-border group-hover:hidden\"></span>\n                <span class=\"hidden i-ic-baseline-favorite text-red group-hover:block\"></span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"card-label bg-beige\">\n                Mafia            </span>\n            </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"relative w-full px-5 py-8 lg:pr-14 lg:pl-10\">\n        <div class=\"relative flex flex-col w-full\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-sm mb-2 lg:mb-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-6 tracking-wider text-gray-900 uppercase text-anthracite group-hover:text-yellow\">\n                        <a href=\"/activity/mange-sandbank/\">Excursion to Mange Sandbank</a>\n                    </h3>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">The Mange Sandbank lies in the south of the Mafia Archipelago and is the most pristine patch of pure, white sand set in the bluest ocean. Exposed only on low tide, it’s surrounded by tropical reefs teaming with colourful corals and fish. To reach the sandbank, you first sail an hour and a half over […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/mange-sandbank/\" data-id=\"14827\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","14879":"<article class=\"relative flex flex-col isolate bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"597\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-1024x597.jpg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-1024x597.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-300x175.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-768x448.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-1536x896.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-2048x1195.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/w-swimming-with-shale-shark-60x35.jpg 60w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" title=\"Wishlist\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-10 h-10 text-2xl leading-none bg-white rounded-full transition-colors group text-anthracite\" data-wishlist-post-id=\"14879\" data-wishlist-post-type=\"excursions\">\n                <span class=\"i-ic-baseline-favorite-border group-hover:hidden\"></span>\n                <span class=\"hidden i-ic-baseline-favorite text-red group-hover:block\"></span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"card-label bg-beige\">\n                Mafia            </span>\n            </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"relative w-full px-5 py-8 lg:pr-14 lg:pl-10\">\n        <div class=\"relative flex flex-col w-full\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-sm mb-2 lg:mb-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold leading-6 tracking-wider text-gray-900 uppercase text-anthracite group-hover:text-yellow\">\n                        <a href=\"/activity/whale-shark-tour-mafia/\">Swimming with whale sharks</a>\n                    </h3>\n\n                                    </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">Near Mafia Island you can go swimming with the world’s largest fish – the impressive but gentle whale sharks that pass by the island from November to March. These gentle giants can grow up to be over 20 meters long, but despite their size they only feed on plankton and small fish. This makes it […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/activity/whale-shark-tour-mafia/\" data-id=\"14879\" id=\"js-excursions-toggle\">\n                View this activity            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>"},"order":{"":["14879","14827","14824","14820","14816","14810","14800","14766"]},"matches":{"excursion_locations":{"mafia":["14879","14827","14824","14820","14816","14810","14800","14766"]}}}